{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785230254744", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "我已经掌握了扎实的事实依据。关键发现：Earnings-22 实际上有 119 小时（而非论文摘要中声称的 160 小时），arXiv ID 为 2203.15591。此外，还有一篇相关的“Contextual Earnings-22”后续论文（2604.07354，2026 年 3 月）。论文中引用了 SPGISpeech 2.0 (2508.05554)。Parakeet-TDT 论文为 Xu 等人 2023 年的研究 (PMLR)。我来确认一下 Earnings-22 的时长差异和 Open ASR Leaderboard 的相关性。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "56329db5-c377-41fc-aa2c-a3444e3b2bbc", "uuid": "c9916e30-540e-48e9-b431-f66528ca3e5c"}
{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785230254744", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "chatcmpl-tool-b5c510a142554866", "name": "Bash", "input": {"command": "curl -sL \"https://arxiv.org/abs/2203.15591\" -o /tmp/e22_real.html 2>&1; python3 -c \"\nimport re\nwith open('/tmp/e22_real.html') as f: h=f.read()\nt=re.sub(r'<[^>]+>',' ',h); t=re.sub(r'\\s+',' ',t)\ni=t.find('Abstract'); print(t[i:i+1500] if i>0 else 'NOT FOUND')\n\" 2>&1", "description": "Fetch Earnings-22 real abstract"}}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "56329db5-c377-41fc-aa2c-a3444e3b2bbc", "uuid": "b2e59927-8d5a-4095-b9f6-b5e4e139f8f8"}
