{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785230285519", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "关键发现：Open ASR Leaderboard (arXiv:2510.06961, 2025 年 10 月) 是一个与本文直接相关的基准测试。论文未引用此项。确认 Earnings-22 为 119 小时（论文摘要称约 160 小时——论文中存在事实错误）。让我再核实一下 Open ASR Leaderboard 的范围，以评估它是否涵盖了收益电话会议。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "56329db5-c377-41fc-aa2c-a3444e3b2bbc", "uuid": "6ff3ac81-304f-4915-811c-44590a6d90f5"}
